@host = http://localhost:5000
@adminToken = dev-admin-token

### Danh sách ngôn ngữ
GET {{host}}/languages

### Dịch (JSON)
POST {{host}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "q": "Hello world! How are you today?",
  "source": "auto",
  "target": "vi",
  "format": "text"
}

### Dịch nhiều đoạn (q là mảng)
POST {{host}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "q": ["Good morning", "See you tomorrow"],
  "source": "en",
  "target": "vi"
}

### Dịch HTML
POST {{host}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "q": "<p>Hello <b>world</b>! <code>var x = 1;</code></p>",
  "source": "en",
  "target": "vi",
  "format": "html"
}

### Dịch (form-urlencoded, giống client LibreTranslate)
POST {{host}}/translate
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

q=Xin chào thế giới&source=vi&target=en

### Nhận diện ngôn ngữ
POST {{host}}/detect
Content-Type: application/json

{ "q": "Bonjour tout le monde" }

### Cấu hình frontend
GET {{host}}/frontend/settings

### [Admin] Tạo API key
POST {{host}}/admin/keys
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test app", "reqLimit": 120, "charLimit": 10000 }

### [Admin] Danh sách API key
GET {{host}}/admin/keys
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### [Admin] Model đã cài
GET {{host}}/admin/models
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### [Admin] Quét lại thư mục model
POST {{host}}/admin/models/reload
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
